    "markdown": "![Hugging Face's logo](https://huggingface.co/front/assets/huggingface_logo-noborder.svg) Hugging Face⟨1⟩\n  *  Models ⟨2⟩\n  *  Datasets ⟨3⟩\n  *  Spaces ⟨4⟩\n  *  Buckets new⟨5⟩\n  *  Docs ⟨6⟩\n  *  Enterprise ⟨7⟩\n  * Pricing⟨8⟩\n  *     * Website\n      *  Tasks⟨9⟩\n      *  HuggingChat⟨10⟩\n      *  Collections⟨11⟩\n      *  Languages⟨12⟩\n      *  Organizations⟨13⟩\n    * Community\n      *  Blog⟨14⟩\n      *  Posts⟨15⟩\n      *  Daily Papers⟨16⟩\n      *  Hardware⟨17⟩\n      *  Learn⟨18⟩\n      *  Discord⟨19⟩\n      *  Forum⟨20⟩\n      *  GitHub⟨21⟩\n    * Solutions\n      *  Team & Enterprise⟨7⟩\n      *  Hugging Face PRO⟨22⟩\n      *  Enterprise Support⟨23⟩\n      *  Inference Providers⟨24⟩\n      *  Inference Endpoints⟨25⟩\n      *  Storage Buckets⟨5⟩\n  * * * *\n  * Log In⟨26⟩\n  * Sign Up⟨27⟩\n\n\n#   Datasets:⟨3⟩\n* * *\n ![](https://huggingface.co/avatars/1b4555f56ff93c2d7f275ac354b5c141.svg) ⟨28⟩\nMortallll⟨28⟩\n/\nunderwater_test_enhance_results⟨29⟩\nlike 0\nTasks:  Image-to-Image ⟨30⟩\nModalities:  Image ⟨31⟩\nFormats:  imagefolder ⟨32⟩\nSize:  1K - 10K ⟨33⟩\nTags:  underwater-image-enhancement ⟨34⟩ image-enhancement ⟨35⟩\nLibraries:  Datasets ⟨36⟩\nCroissant\n Dataset card ⟨29⟩ Data Studio ⟨37⟩ Files Files and versions xet ⟨38⟩ Community 1 ⟨39⟩\nDataset Viewer\n Auto-converted to Parquet⟨40⟩ API Embed  Duplicate⟨41⟩ Data Studio\nSubset (1)\ndefault · 3.45k rows\ndefault (3.45k rows)\nSplit (1)\ntest · 3.45k rows\ntest (3.45k rows)\nSearch is not available for this dataset\nSQL\nConsole\nThe dataset viewer is not available for this split.\nServer error while post-processing the rows. Please report the issue.\n\n```\nError code:   RowsPostProcessingError\n\n```\n\nNeed help to make the dataset viewer work? Make sure to review how to configure the dataset viewer⟨42⟩, and open a discussion⟨43⟩ for direct support.\n  * Archive⟨44⟩\n  * Methods And Outputs⟨45⟩\n\n\n#   ⟨46⟩ Underwater Test Enhancement Results \nThis private dataset repository stores the packaged outputs of the underwater image enhancement reproduction run dated 2026-07-09.\n##   ⟨44⟩ Archive \n  * File: `results/underwater_test_enhance_20260709/underwater_test_enhance_20260709_results.zip`\n  * Size: 2,196,977,738 bytes\n  * SHA256: `2a68c68a75aa853d8eb7008db3f9ccce647fd349639a9fa4f65d4b812f03041a`\n  * Source dataset: `BitStrawber/underwater_test`\n\n\nThe archive contains `outputs/`, `manifests/`, `visual_checks/`, and `run_summary.md`. It excludes the original 26 GB source videos, copied runtime environments, checkpoints, and caches.\n##   ⟨45⟩ Methods And Outputs \nThe run includes seven configurations across three methods:\n  * FA+Net: alpha 0.1\n  * LiteEnhanceNet: epoch 99\n  * EnDiff: official, 0.2, 0.6, 0.9, and 1.0\n\n\nEach configuration contains 90 enhanced images, 150 enhanced sampled video frames, and 10 sampled MP4 summaries. The 10 source videos were sampled uniformly at 15 frames each; output MP4 files preserve the original 30 fps and therefore last about 0.5 seconds.\nThe source dataset has no paired ground truth. These outputs should not be presented as a PSNR/SSIM ranking without an additional evaluation protocol.\nCopy to bucket new\nUse this dataset \n\nDownloads last month\n    78\nNumber of rows: 3,451 Total file size: 236 GB\nSystem theme\nCompany\nTOS⟨47⟩ Privacy⟨48⟩ About⟨49⟩ Careers⟨50⟩ ⟨1⟩\nWebsite\nModels⟨2⟩ Datasets⟨3⟩ Spaces⟨4⟩ Pricing⟨8⟩ Docs⟨6⟩\n",
